  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"227\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"227\">About Our Brand and Products</strong></h3><p data-start=\"228\" data-end=\"831\">Frenchies Hairpins is a women-founded beauty brand revolutionizing hair styling with our patented <strong data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"353\">flocked velvet hairpins</strong>. Unlike slippery metal pins, Frenchies are covered in soft velvet that creates friction, ensuring a&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"507\">stronger, more comfortable, and long-lasting hold</strong>—without damage or slipping.<br data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"538\">Our collection includes <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"603\">hairpins and accessories</strong> loved by stylists, dancers, brides, and everyday women who want their hair to stay effortlessly in place. Frenchies are available on <strong data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"801\">Amazon, our online store, and in select salons and boutiques</strong> across the U.S. and Europe.</p><hr data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\"><h3 data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"869\"><strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"869\">What Makes Us Different</strong></h3><p data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"1243\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"896\">Patented Innovation:</strong> The only hairpin on the market covered in flocked velvet for superior grip.<br data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"975\"><strong data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1005\">Comfort Meets Function:</strong> No poking, slipping, or hair damage.<br data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\"><strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1069\">Universal Appeal:</strong> Ideal for all hair types and textures—from fine to thick, straight to curly.<br data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1149\"><strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1176\">Aesthetic &amp; Premium:</strong> Beautifully designed pins that blend elegance with practicality.</p><hr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1248\"><h