our bio, blog, or story highlights.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2074\"><h3 data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2101\"><strong data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2101\">Other Information</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2441\"><li data-start=\"2102\" data-end=\"2201\"><p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2201\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2198\">beauty influencers, hair stylists, dancers, bridal experts, and moms on the go</strong>.</p></li><li data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2265\"><p data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2265\">Our products are lightweight, durable, and travel-friendly.</p></li><li data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2336\"><p data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2336\">We’re expanding globally—now available in select European markets!</p></li><li data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2441\"><p data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2441\">You’ll get access to our <strong data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2415\">brand assets, product photos, and content ideas</strong> to make promotion easy.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
